{"page":467,"verses":[{"verse_key":"39:75","surah":39,"ayah":75,"ar_uthmani":"وَتَرَى ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةَ حَآفِّينَ مِنْ حَوْلِ ٱلْعَرْشِ يُسَبِّحُونَ بِحَمْدِ رَبِّهِمْ ۖ وَقُضِىَ بَيْنَهُم بِٱلْحَقِّ وَقِيلَ ٱلْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ رَبِّ ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You [Prophet] will see the angels surrounding the Throne, glorifying their Lord with praise. True judgement will have been passed between them, and it will be said, ‘Praise be to God, the Lord of the Worlds.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَتَرَى","en_gloss":"And you will see","transliteration":"watarā","verse_key":"39:75"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةَ","en_gloss":"the Angels","transliteration":"l-malāikata","verse_key":"39:75"},{"pos":3,"ar":"حَآفِّينَ","en_gloss":"surrounding","transliteration":"ḥāffīna","verse_key":"39:75"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"[from]","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"39:75"},{"pos":5,"ar":"حَوْلِ","en_gloss":"around","transliteration":"ḥawli","verse_key":"39:75"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْعَرْشِ","en_gloss":"the Throne","transliteration":"l-ʿarshi","verse_key":"39:75"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يُسَبِّحُونَ","en_gloss":"glorifying","transliteration":"yusabbiḥūna","verse_key":"39:75"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِحَمْدِ","en_gloss":"(the) praise","transliteration":"biḥamdi","verse_key":"39:75"},{"pos":9,"ar":"رَبِّهِمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"(of) their Lord","transliteration":"rabbihim","verse_key":"39:75"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَقُضِىَ","en_gloss":"And (will) be judged","transliteration":"waquḍiya","verse_key":"39:75"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بَيْنَهُم","en_gloss":"between them","transliteration":"baynahum","verse_key":"39:75"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","en_gloss":"in truth","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","verse_key":"39:75"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَقِيلَ","en_gloss":"and it will be said","transliteration":"waqīla","verse_key":"39:75"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْحَمْدُ","en_gloss":"All praise be","transliteration":"l-ḥamdu","verse_key":"39:75"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"to Allah","transliteration":"lillahi","vers